Ugh... maybe I'm in the minority here, but I find autocursing a
distasteful aspect of the game.  After taking pains to make sure an
object isn't cursed, to have it curse itself seems cheap.  I won't
consider autocursing in brainstorming new items.  Instead, I suggest
curses should be more difficult to detect/remove unless resources are
consumed (scrolls of identify, holy water, scroll of remove curse) or
you're a Priest (which would have the side-effect of making priests
more special again).  That means (bracing myself for the furor) -BUC
ID from dropping on altars should be toned down, or maybe even
outright removed-.

